{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>From the hand of a foreigner.</b> Lest he think in his heart: since it is the offering of a foreigner, I will not be concerned to offer it." "<b>Their blemish.</b> The mem is added and the tav is root, from the root of משחת. And the mem of להיות להם: משחתם — root and the tav is added." "<b>They will be accepted.</b> From the nif'al binyan. And since he mentioned לא ירצה, he mentioned that every offering that is brought before the eighth day — it too will not be accepted."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:46.497561357Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}